Condemning in the strongest terms the terrorist attacks by Hamas that took place in Israel starting on 7 October 2023 and the taking of hostages, and expressing grave concern for the safety and well-being of all civilians,
Deploring the loss of civilian lives in Israel and Gaza, and condemning all violence against civilians,
